#mucom88 1.7
#title Gradius II Take Care! (Boss)
#composer Konami Kukeiha Club
#author ToughkidCST
#comment Gradius II -Gofer no Yabou- (X68000)
#voice GRADIUS2.DAT
#pcm GRADIUS2.BIN
#CarrierCorrection Yes
; Requires current MucoMSX MSX PSG/SCC extensions (msPb0102).
; YM2151 FM -> OPNA FM: A=ch1 B=ch2 C=ch3 H=ch4 I=ch6 J=ch7
; YM2151 FM -> SCC wave+envelope: SCCA=ch5
; K = MSM6258 ADPCM -> ADPCM-B (GRADIUS2.BIN)
; F = tempo only: Timer-B values alternate so 1 clock = 1 driver tick

; SCC waves: steady-state shape of the YM2151 voices
  @W0:{ 0,78,125,127,92,38,-14,-55,-82,-96,-102,-101,-94,-80,-59,-31,0,31,59,80,94,101,102,96,82,55,14,-38,-92,-127,-125,-78 }

; macros (#*n{...} is pasted where *n stands)
#*1{o5g+8. v108 g+8. v105 g+8. q5 g+ v123}
#*2{o7c <g d b g d}
#*3{o4g+ D0 d+ c D-2 a+ D-5 f D-8 d}
#*4{D-4 o4g+ D0}
#*5{D-5 o4g}
#*6{D-5 o4f D0 c D-1 <f D-5 >f D0 c}
#*7{D-7 o5d+ D-8 c}
#*8{D-13 o5g D0 d}
#*9{o5f D-8 c}

A C144 l16 vm2 r72 L MF0 @5 v126 p3 D9 q5 o3g+1 q18 >g+1 q5 <g1 q18 >g1

B C144 l16 vm2 r72 L r MF0 @19 v123 p3 D-3 q14 o4g+8. v114 g+8. v111 g+8. v108
B g+8. v105 g+8. q5 g+ v123 q14 >g+8. v114 g+8. v111 *1 q14 <g8. v114 g8. v111
B g8. v108 g8. v105 g8. q5 g v123 q14 >g8. v114 g8. v111 g8. v108 g8. v105 g8.

C C144 l16 vm2 r72 L MF0 @31 v117 p3 q7 o7d+ c <d+ >d <a+ f [ >c <g+ d+ ]2 >c
C <d+ >d <f >d+ <g+ f >d <a+ f [ >c <g+ d+ ]2 >c <f >d <g+ *2 [ a f c ]2 a f b
C g *2 [ a f c ]2 a f b d

F C144 l16 t228 r144 t228 r144 L t222 r144 t221 r144

H C144 l16 vm2 r72 L MF0 @32 v113 p3 D2 q1 [ o4g+ >d+ ]16 [ <g D1 >d D2 ]15 <g
H D1 >d

I C144 l16 vm2 r72 L MF0 @5 v112 p1 D-4 q3 o3g+1 q9 >g+1 q3 <g1 q9 >g1

J C144 l16 vm2 r72 L MF0 @19 v123 p3 q15 o5g+8. v114 g+8. v115 *1 q15 >g+8.
J v114 g+8. v115 g+8. v108 g+8. v105 g+8. q5 g+ v123 q15 <g8. v114 g8. v115 g8.
J v108 g8. v105 g8. q5 g v123 q15 >g8. v114 g8. v115 g8. v108 g8. v105 g8. q5 g

K C144 l16 r144 L r144 @11 D31695 p3 v240 o1c%86 r%58 c%85 r%59 c%86 r%58 c%86
K r%57

SCCA C144 l16 r72 L MF0 @0 E0,194,0,255,0,1 v11 D-4 q8 *3 [ *4 d+ c ]2 *4 c D-2
SCCA a+ D-8 d D-4 *3 [ *4 d+ c ]2 *4 c D-2 a+ [ D-8 d *5 D-8 d D-1 <g *5 D-8 d
SCCA D-1 <g *6 D-1 <f D-5 >f D0 c *5 ]2 D-2 <b [ D-13 o5g *7 D-5 f D0 d D-2 <a+
SCCA *7 D-4 <g+ *7 D-4 <g+ *7 D-5 f D0 d ]2 [ *8 *5 ]2 [ *9 D-5 <f ]2 *9 [ *8
